            "name": "w8_unavailable",
            "textbox_spec": "## Two panels are deliberately absent\n\n**Feature freshness lag** and **training/serving skew** are not plotted here, and are not approximated. Both need an online feature store, which bills purely for existing and is torn down between windows at a measured idle rate of **$12.06/day**.\n\n**Skew is no longer unmeasured, though.** Phase 8 measured it on 2026-09-08: **100.00% exact agreement** across **1,916** repo keys and **1,543** actor keys, on all four feature columns, with the offline side read over SQL and the served side over a direct Postgres connection. It is absent from *this* page because Lakebase is not offered in this workspace's region -- the stack lives in a separate root module in centralus, and it was destroyed when the window closed. See `docs/findings/2026-09-08-training-serving-skew-measured.md`.\n\nThey are marked rather than dropped for the same reason the Photon A/B withheld an indeterminate arm: an absent panel a reader cannot see is indistinguishable from a panel nobody thought of."
